---------- Recipe via Meal-Master (tm) v8.05
 
      Title: Layer Cake
 Categories: Dessert
      Yield: 1 cake
 
      2 c  Flour                              1 ts Salt
      1 c  Sugar                              3 ea Eggs
-----------------------------Icing-----------------------------
      2 c  Icing sugar
 
  Bake the layers and sandwich with icing.
 
